==Description==

This BIP assigns flag byte 0x02 under Tapscript leaf version 0xc2 ([0xc2 BIP]) to the Schnorr signature scheme specified in [https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0340.mediawiki BIP 340]. BIP 340 is the definitive specification for this scheme; this document defines only its integration into 0xc2 script semantics.

==Flag Byte==

0x02

==Parameters==

As specified in BIP 340.

==Verification Procedure==

Given a non-empty ''signature'' and ''pubkey_data'':

# If ''pubkey_data'' is not 32 bytes, return false.
# If ''signature'' is not 64 or 65 bytes, return false.
# If 64 bytes: let ''hash_type'' = 0x00.
# If 65 bytes: let ''hash_type'' be the final byte; return false if it is 0x00 or invalid per BIP 341.
# Compute the signature message per BIP 341 with the BIP 342 Tapscript extension, using ''key_version'' = 0x02. Return false if the message cannot be computed.
# Apply BIP 340 ''Verify'' to the first 64 bytes of ''signature'', ''pubkey_data'', and the message. Return the result.

==Sigops Cost==

Flat 50 units per verification — identical to leaf version 0xc0, since verification is unchanged from BIP 340/342. This is the baseline against which future scheme BIPs scale their costs. The same static cost is returned regardless of whether verification succeeds or fails early.

